text = "[b]This scene demonstrates the basic text chat of Neocortex.[/b]

[b][color=#F59E0B]01[/color][/b] Type in the chat box and have a conversation with Cora.
[b][color=#F59E0B]02[/color][/b] Restart the scene and pick the conversation up where you left off.
[b][color=#F59E0B]03[/color][/b] Press New Chat Session to start from scratch, as if it is the first time you chat with Cora."
